ad"}], "flags": {}, "id": 105, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [141], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [511.67822265625, 654.1578369140625], "pos": [1881.820068359375, 9654.779296875], "widgets_values": ["Analyze the split-screen input image as a comprehensive apparel synthesis task:\n\nLeft Panel (Product Source): Contains one or more specific fashion items (garments, footwear, or accessories) \n\nRight Panel (Subject Source): A model standing in a specific pose, wearing different clothing.\n\nGoal: Generate a single, high-fidelity photo by replacing the model's current clothing with the exact items shown in the Left Panel.\n\nUniversal Execution Directives:\n\nIntelligent Item Mapping: Identify all distinct apparel items in the Left Panel and map them to the corresponding body parts of the model in the Right Panel (e.g., upper-body items to torso, lower-body items to legs).\n\nAbsolute Visual Fidelity: Preserve 100% of the visual DNA from the Left Panel: including exact colors, fabric textures, complex patterns, logos, and any text or graphic prints.\n\nAnatomic Wrap & Drape: The new garments must conform to the model's physical pose, body contours, and movement in the Right Panel. Calculate realistic folds, tension lines, and fabric shadows based on the model's position.\n\nEnvironment-Aware Lighting: Re-render the light and shadow on the new clothing to match the specific light source direction, intensity, and color temperature of the Right Panel's scene.\n\nContextual Integrity: Keep the model's identity (face, hair, skin tone) and the entire background/UI elements from the Right Panel completely unchanged.\n\nConstraints:\n\nNO HALLUCINATION: Do not invent new details; only use what is provided in the Left Panel.\n\nSEAMLESS FUSION: The final image must look like a real photograph, with no artifacts at the edges where clothing meets skin.\"\n\nPay attention to the front and back relationship of the clothes. The patterns on the back should not appear on the front.\n\nOnly output [one image] in the end. Not output the left image (Product Source)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 108, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "*", "links": [135], "label": "*", "type": "*", "localized_name": "*"}], "size": [562.786865234375, 106], "pos": [2833.357666015625, 9343.1494140625], "widgets_values": [3, "single", "reuse"], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 141, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}, {"widget": {"name": "repeats"}, "name": "repeats", "label": "repeats", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "repeats"}, {"widget": {"name": "output"}, "name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "output"}, {"widget": {"name": "node_mode"}, "name": "node_mode", "label": "node_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "node_mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 115, "type": "Repeater|pysssss", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "Repeater|pysssss", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "VHS_Metad